# golang.org/x/crypto/openpgp is deprecated upstream by design — no fixed
# version exists or ever will, so this finding is not actionable. Trivy flags
# the whole golang.org/x/crypto module, but bootstrap/ imports only
# golang.org/x/crypto/ssh{,/agent,/knownhosts} (Proxmox node discovery);
# `go mod why golang.org/x/crypto/openpgp` reports "main module does not need
# package". x/crypto module updates continue to flow via Renovate.
GO-2026-5932

# extensions/iscsi-tools/Dockerfile packages a Talos system-extension image:
# an OCI-shaped filesystem payload (manifest.yaml + rootfs/) consumed by the
# Talos imager, never run as a container. Container-runtime hardening rules
# do not apply — there is no process to HEALTHCHECK (DS-0026), and no USER to
# drop to (DS-0002): Talos launches the packaged iscsid as a host service,
# which must be root to manage kernel iSCSI sessions.
DS-0002
DS-0026
